==Event Information==
<tabber>
Start=
It's 2 years since the release of The Battle Cats POP! for 3DS!<br>
Celebrate at the Legend Stages starting June 27th at 11am!

Play the Battle Cats POP! and Cat Kart Awakens maps in Legend Stages to help unlock Rare Tickets for all players!

For every 200,000 total stage clears from ALL Battle Cats players combined, everyone will earn a Rare Ticket present!

Up to 3 Rare Tickets can be unlocked during this event if a total of 600,000 plays is reached before July 12th!

※Rewards will be delivered on a date to be announced after all conditions have been met.

